        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2561] In case PnC was selected as authorization service, unless otherwise stated, anytime an element is prefixed with PnC (e.g. PnC_AReqAuthorizationMode), it shall be used. Anytime an element is prefixed with EIM (e.g. EIM_AReqAuthorizationMode), it shall not be used.",
